# NEVER add fake Google reviews

## Forbidden

- Hardcoded review arrays (RAW, ALL_REVIEWS, GOOGLE_FEATURED_REVIEWS with static entries)
- Fallback to static reviews when API fails or returns empty
- Merging API reviews with static seed data in bundle or frontend
- Playwright mock review data in production bundles

## Required

- Reviews section: **only** `GET /api/google-reviews` (Place ID `ChIJG17BnG_bZiARTsOUc0JlvyE`)
- API error or empty → show empty-state message, never substitute fake names
- After bundle edits: `node --check assets/index-utf8-v4.js` and grep for fake names (`James W.`, `Sarah J.`, etc.)

## Prod files

- `src/pages/home.tsx`, `src/data/reviews.ts` (empty array), `assets/index-utf8-v4.js`, `index.html` cache bump
